; village_lane_west.room - the market lane (design 04 section 3.1): stalls, the bakery and the empty house doors.
; One street at ground level (design 04 section 1, "Vila plana"). The west fence (col 3) opens with owns_memorina (design 04 section 2); the gatehouse ceiling is 4 cells above its floor, so it cannot be jumped.
; Village voices (STORY-09, systems/story): a talk beside the seller (col 18), gone with him at 0.6 (presence 0.7).

